"                                                </div>\n"
"                                                <center><img src=\"https://www.aldahotels.es/firma/email/llegada/check-in.png\" alt=\"Registra l’entrada\" width=\"80px\" height=\"80px\" href=\"%24%7Bobject.get_portal_url()%7D\"></center></a>\n"
